{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Erstelle eine neue, hochwertige und vollständig responsive FAQ-Section für DocMed im bestehenden Shop-Design.
    
    Die Section soll eine maximale Breite von 1500 px haben, mittig auf der Seite ausgerichtet sein und auf Desktop standardmäßig zweispaltig dargestellt werden. Auf Tablet und Mobile soll sie automatisch responsiv reagieren und auf Mobile einspaltig dargestellt werden. Die Section darf auf keiner Bildschirmgröße horizontal überlaufen.
    
    Oben soll die Section aus einer kleinen Eyebrow, einer Hauptüberschrift und einem kurzen Beschreibungstext bestehen. Darunter folgen die FAQ-Einträge als Accordion-Elemente. Jede Frage soll in einer eigenen, cleanen Card bzw. Zeile dargestellt werden, mit der Frage links und einem Plus-Icon rechts. Beim Öffnen soll sich das Plus-Icon in ein Minus-Icon ändern und die Antwort direkt darunter erscheinen.
    
    Wichtig ist, dass die FAQ-Inhalte sowohl manuell als auch dynamisch über Shopify-Metafelder gepflegt werden können.
    
    Ich möchte im Theme Editor auswählen können, ob die FAQ-Inhalte aus:
    - manuellen Blocks,
    - Produkt-Metafeldern,
    - oder einer Kombination aus beiden
    
    geladen werden.
    
    Für Produktseiten sollen passende FAQ-Metafelder verwendet werden können, zum Beispiel:
    - FAQ 1 Frage
    - FAQ 1 Antwort
    - FAQ 2 Frage
    - FAQ 2 Antwort
    - FAQ 3 Frage
    - FAQ 3 Antwort
    - FAQ 4 Frage
    - FAQ 4 Antwort
    - FAQ 5 Frage
    - FAQ 5 Antwort
    
    Wenn technisch sinnvoller, kann alternativ auch eine Metaobject-Liste verwendet werden. Wichtig ist, dass die Section automatisch die FAQs des aktuell geöffneten Produkts übernimmt.
    
    Ich möchte möglichst alle Designparameter direkt im Shopify Theme Editor bearbeiten können.
    
    Folgende Einstellungen sollen verfügbar sein:
    
    - maximale Section-Breite bis 1500 px
    - Section-Hintergrundfarbe
    - FAQ-Card-Hintergrundfarbe
    - Eyebrow-Farbe
    - Überschriftenfarbe
    - Beschreibungstext-Farbe
    - Farbe der Fragen
    - Farbe der Antworten
    - Border-Farbe
    - aktive Border-Farbe
    - Hover-Farbe
    - Plus-/Minus-Icon-Farbe
    - Border Radius
    - Border-Stärke
    - Section-Padding oben und unten
    - seitliches Padding
    - Abstand zwischen den FAQ-Items
    - Abstand zwischen den beiden Desktop-Spalten
    - Innenabstand der FAQ-Cards
    - Schriftgröße der Eyebrow
    - Schriftgröße der Hauptüberschrift
    - Schriftgröße der Beschreibung
    - Schriftgröße der Fragen
    - Schriftgröße der Antworten
    - Schriftstärke
    - Zeilenhöhe
    - separate Desktop-, Tablet- und Mobile-Schriftgrößen
    - separate Mobile-Paddings und Abstände
    
    Das Accordion-Verhalten soll ebenfalls konfigurierbar sein. Ich möchte einstellen können:
    - ob nur eine Frage gleichzeitig geöffnet sein darf,
    - ob mehrere Fragen gleichzeitig geöffnet sein können,
    - ob das erste FAQ beim Laden automatisch geöffnet ist.
    
    Desktop:
    Die FAQ-Einträge sollen standardmäßig in zwei gleich breiten Spalten dargestellt werden. Beide Spalten sollen sauber ausgerichtet sein und möglichst gleichmäßig wirken.
    
    Mobile:
    Auf Mobile sollen alle FAQs einspaltig untereinander dargestellt werden. Die FAQ-Cards sollen fast die gesamte Bildschirmbreite nutzen, mit ca. 16–20 px Außenabstand. Schriftgrößen und Abstände sollen automatisch angepasst werden. Die Plus-/Minus-Icons müssen ausreichend große Touch-Flächen haben.
    
    Designstil:
    Clean, medizinisch, hochwertig, professionell und zurückhaltend. Keine starken Schatten oder überladenen Effekte. Die Standardfarben können an der DocMed-CI orientiert sein:
    - Dunkelblau: #1D2E40
    - Türkis: #7FC7CF
    - Weiß / sehr helles Blau
    - neutrales Dunkelgrau
    
    Wichtig: Diese Farben dürfen nicht fest programmiert sein, sondern müssen im Theme Editor vollständig überschreibbar sein.
    
    Die Section soll technisch sauber, schnell und für Produktseiten optimiert sein, damit jedes Produkt eigene FAQ-Inhalte über Metafelder erhalten kann.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% assign product_faq_source = block.settings.faq_source %}
{% style %}
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background: {{ block.settings.section_bg }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.pad_top }}px {{ block.settings.side_pad }}px {{ block.settings.pad_bottom }}px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%; max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__header { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto {{ block.settings.items_gap }}px; text-align: {{ block.settings.alignment }}; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow { color: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }}; font-size: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_size }}px; line-height: 1.4; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }}; font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px; line-height: {{ block.settings.line_height }}; font-weight: {{ block.settings.font_weight }}; margin: 0 0 12px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro { color: {{ block.settings.description_color }}; font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px; line-height: {{ block.settings.line_height }}; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro p { margin: 0; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: {{ block.settings.items_gap }}px {{ block.settings.column_gap }}px; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item { min-width: 0; background: {{ block.settings.card_bg }}; border: {{ block.settings.border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}; border-radius: {{ block.settings.radius }}px; overflow: hidden; transition: border-color .18s ease, background-color .18s ease; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item:hover { background: {{ block.settings.hover_color }}; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item.is-open { border-color: {{ block.settings.active_border }}; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; width: 100%; min-height: 58px; padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px; border: 0; background: transparent; color: {{ block.settings.question_color }}; text-align: left; font: inherit; font-size: {{ block.settings.question_size }}px; font-weight: {{ block.settings.font_weight }}; line-height: {{ block.settings.line_height }}; cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid {{ block.settings.icon_color }}; outline-offset: -3px; border-radius: {{ block.settings.radius }}px; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon { flex: 0 0 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; position: relative; color: {{ block.settings.icon_color }}; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon::before, .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 11px; left: 4px; width: 16px; height: 2px; background: currentColor; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon::after { transform: rotate(90deg); transition: transform .18s ease; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question[aria-expanded="true"] .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon::after { transform: rotate(0); }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__answer { padding: 0 {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px; color: {{ block.settings.answer_color }}; font-size: {{ block.settings.answer_size }}px; line-height: {{ block.settings.line_height }}; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__answer p { margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__answer p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 989px) and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width: 100%; }
    .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { font-size: {{ block.settings.tablet_heading }}px; }
    .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question { font-size: {{ block.settings.tablet_question }}px; }
    .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__answer { font-size: {{ block.settings.tablet_answer }}px; }
    .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list { gap: {{ block.settings.tablet_gap }}px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding: {{ block.settings.mobile_top }}px {{ block.settings.mobile_side }}px {{ block.settings.mobile_bottom }}px; }
    .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width: 100%; }
    .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_gap }}px; }
    .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__header { margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.mobile_gap }}px; }
    .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow { font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_eyebrow }}px; }
    .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_heading }}px; }
    .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro { font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_description }}px; }
    .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question { min-height: 56px; padding: {{ block.settings.mobile_card_padding }}px; font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_question }}px; gap: 12px; }
    .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__answer { padding: 0 {{ block.settings.mobile_card_padding }}px {{ block.settings.mobile_card_padding }}px; font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_answer }}px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item, .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon::after { transition: none; } }
{% endstyle %}

<docmed-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-single="{{ block.settings.single_open }}" data-first="{{ block.settings.first_open }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    {% if block.settings.eyebrow != blank or block.settings.heading != blank or block.settings.description != blank %}
      <header class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__header">
        {% if block.settings.eyebrow != blank %}<p class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}<h2 class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.description != blank %}<div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro">{{ block.settings.description }}</div>{% endif %}
      </header>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list">
      {% if product_faq_source != 'manual' and product != blank %}
        {% for i in (1..5) %}
          {% assign qkey = 'faq_' | append: i | append: '_question' %}
          {% assign akey = 'faq_' | append: i | append: '_answer' %}
          {% assign question_field = product.metafields.custom[qkey] %}
          {% assign answer_field = product.metafields.custom[akey] %}
          {% if question_field != blank and answer_field != blank %}
            <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item" data-faq-item>
              <button class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-{{ ai_gen_id }}-meta-{{ i }}"><span>{{ question_field.value | escape }}</span><span class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
              <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__answer" id="faq-panel-{{ ai_gen_id }}-meta-{{ i }}" hidden>{{ answer_field | metafield_tag }}</div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
      {% if product_faq_source != 'metafields' %}
        {% for i in (1..5) %}
          {% assign qkey = 'manual_q_' | append: i %}
          {% assign akey = 'manual_a_' | append: i %}
          {% assign manual_question = block.settings[qkey] %}
          {% assign manual_answer = block.settings[akey] %}
          {% if manual_question != blank and manual_answer != blank %}
            <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item" data-faq-item>
              <button class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-{{ ai_gen_id }}-manual-{{ i }}"><span>{{ manual_question | escape }}</span><span class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
              <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__answer" id="faq-panel-{{ ai_gen_id }}-manual-{{ i }}" hidden>{{ manual_answer }}</div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <script>
    (() => {
      const tagName = 'docmed-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}';
      if (customElements.get(tagName)) return;
      customElements.define(tagName, class extends HTMLElement {
        connectedCallback() {
          const items = [...this.querySelectorAll('[data-faq-item]')];
          const single = this.dataset.single === 'true';
          const setOpen = (item, open) => {
            const button = item.querySelector('button');
            const panel = item.querySelector('.ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__answer');
            button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));
            panel.hidden = !open;
            item.classList.toggle('is-open', open);
          };
          items.forEach((item) => item.querySelector('button').addEventListener('click', () => {
            const opening = item.querySelector('button').getAttribute('aria-expanded') !== 'true';
            if (opening && single) items.forEach((other) => setOpen(other, false));
            setOpen(item, opening);
          }));
          if (this.dataset.first === 'true' && items.length) setOpen(items[0], true);
        }
      });
    })();
  </script>
</docmed-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "DocMed FAQ",
  "settings": [
    {"type":"select","id":"faq_source","label":"FAQ-Inhalte aus","options":[{"value":"manual","label":"Manuelle Inhalte"},{"value":"metafields","label":"Produkt-Metafelder"},{"value":"both","label":"Kombination"}],"default":"both"},
    {"type":"text","id":"eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow","default":"Häufige Fragen"},
    {"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Überschrift","default":"Fragen und Antworten"},
    {"type":"richtext","id":"description","label":"Beschreibung","default":"<p>Hier finden Sie hilfreiche Informationen zu unseren Produkten.</p>"},
    {"type":"select","id":"alignment","label":"Kopfzeile ausrichten","options":[{"value":"left","label":"Links"},{"value":"center","label":"Mittig"}],"default":"left"},
    {"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop-Breite","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},
    {"type":"range","id":"max_width","label":"Maximale Breite","min":800,"max":1500,"step":50,"unit":"px","default":1500},
    {"type":"header","content":"Accordion"},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"single_open","label":"Nur ein Eintrag gleichzeitig öffnen","default":true},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"first_open","label":"Ersten Eintrag automatisch öffnen","default":false},
    {"type":"header","content":"Manuelle FAQs"},
    {"type":"text","id":"manual_q_1","label":"Frage 1"},{"type":"richtext","id":"manual_a_1","label":"Antwort 1"},
    {"type":"text","id":"manual_q_2","label":"Frage 2"},{"type":"richtext","id":"manual_a_2","label":"Antwort 2"},
    {"type":"text","id":"manual_q_3","label":"Frage 3"},{"type":"richtext","id":"manual_a_3","label":"Antwort 3"},
    {"type":"text","id":"manual_q_4","label":"Frage 4"},{"type":"richtext","id":"manual_a_4","label":"Antwort 4"},
    {"type":"text","id":"manual_q_5","label":"Frage 5"},{"type":"richtext","id":"manual_a_5","label":"Antwort 5"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Farben und Karten"},
    {"type":"color","id":"section_bg","label":"Section-Hintergrund","default":"#FFFFFF"},
    {"type":"color","id":"card_bg","label":"Card-Hintergrund","default":"#F8FCFE"},
    {"type":"color","id":"eyebrow_color","label":"Eyebrow-Farbe","default":"#1D2E40"},
    {"type":"color","id":"heading_color","label":"Überschriftenfarbe","default":"#1D2E40"},
    {"type":"color","id":"description_color","label":"Beschreibungstext-Farbe","default":"#34495A"},
    {"type":"color","id":"question_color","label":"Fragenfarbe","default":"#1D2E40"},
    {"type":"color","id":"answer_color","label":"Antwortenfarbe","default":"#34495A"},
    {"type":"color","id":"border_color","label":"Border-Farbe","default":"#D7E2E8"},
    {"type":"color","id":"active_border","label":"Aktive Border-Farbe","default":"#7FC7CF"},
    {"type":"color","id":"hover_color","label":"Hover-Farbe","default":"#F2FAFB"},
    {"type":"color","id":"icon_color","label":"Plus-/Minus-Icon-Farbe","default":"#1D2E40"},
    {"type":"range","id":"radius","label":"Border Radius","min":0,"max":30,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":8},
    {"type":"range","id":"border_width","label":"Border-Stärke","min":0,"max":4,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":1},
    {"type":"header","content":"Abstände"},
    {"type":"range","id":"pad_top","label":"Padding oben","min":0,"max":120,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":60},
    {"type":"range","id":"pad_bottom","label":"Padding unten","min":0,"max":120,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":60},
    {"type":"range","id":"side_pad","label":"Seitliches Padding","min":0,"max":60,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":24},
    {"type":"range","id":"items_gap","label":"Abstand FAQ-Items","min":8,"max":40,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":16},
    {"type":"range","id":"column_gap","label":"Desktop-Spaltenabstand","min":8,"max":60,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":24},
    {"type":"range","id":"card_padding","label":"Card-Innenabstand","min":10,"max":40,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":20},
    {"type":"header","content":"Schriftgrößen Desktop"},
    {"type":"range","id":"eyebrow_size","label":"Eyebrow","min":10,"max":20,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":13},
    {"type":"range","id":"heading_size","label":"Überschrift","min":24,"max":60,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":40},
    {"type":"range","id":"description_size","label":"Beschreibung","min":12,"max":24,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":16},
    {"type":"range","id":"question_size","label":"Fragen","min":14,"max":26,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":18},
    {"type":"range","id":"answer_size","label":"Antworten","min":12,"max":22,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":15},
    {"type":"range","id":"font_weight","label":"Schriftstärke Fragen und Titel","min":400,"max":700,"step":100,"default":600},
    {"type":"range","id":"line_height","label":"Zeilenhöhe","min":1,"max":2,"step":0.1,"default":1.5},
    {"type":"header","content":"Tablet und Mobile"},
    {"type":"range","id":"tablet_heading","label":"Tablet Überschrift","min":22,"max":48,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":34},
    {"type":"range","id":"tablet_question","label":"Tablet Fragen","min":14,"max":24,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":17},
    {"type":"range","id":"tablet_answer","label":"Tablet Antworten","min":12,"max":20,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":15},
    {"type":"range","id":"tablet_gap","label":"Tablet Abstand","min":8,"max":32,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":16},
    {"type":"range","id":"mobile_top","label":"Mobile Padding oben","min":10,"max":60,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":30},
    {"type":"range","id":"mobile_bottom","label":"Mobile Padding unten","min":10,"max":60,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":30},
    {"type":"range","id":"mobile_side","label":"Mobile Seitenabstand","min":16,"max":30,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":18},
    {"type":"range","id":"mobile_gap","label":"Mobile Abstand","min":8,"max":24,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":12},
    {"type":"range","id":"mobile_card_padding","label":"Mobile Card-Innenabstand","min":12,"max":28,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":16},
    {"type":"range","id":"mobile_eyebrow","label":"Mobile Eyebrow","min":10,"max":18,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":12},
    {"type":"range","id":"mobile_heading","label":"Mobile Überschrift","min":22,"max":36,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":28},
    {"type":"range","id":"mobile_description","label":"Mobile Beschreibung","min":13,"max":20,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":15},
    {"type":"range","id":"mobile_question","label":"Mobile Fragen","min":14,"max":22,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":16},
    {"type":"range","id":"mobile_answer","label":"Mobile Antworten","min":13,"max":19,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":15}
  ],
  "presets": [{"name":"DocMed FAQ"}],
  "tag": null,
  "class": "docmed-faq-block"
}
{% endschema %}